WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.940
Catch small differences early and keep the
order moving in the right direction.

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:08.575
Have your latest submitted order packet and
factory acknowledgment side by side.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:12.660
Start with the account, project, brand and
ship-to address.

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:17.493
Work through each line: quantity, cabinet
code, dimensions, modifications, door,

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:21.777
species, finish and separately ordered
components. Check whether accessories are
sold

00:00:21.777 --> 00:00:26.060
individually or in pairs or sets.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.845
If something looks different, mark it
clearly and send the correction through the

00:00:30.845 --> 00:00:35.080
factory's process. Check the correction
deadline and save a copy of your request.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:40.030
When the revised acknowledgment arrives,
make sure it matches the requested change.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:44.430
For anything still open, note who is
following up and when you'll check back.
